  "description": "OCR for PdfNetStack: finds the scan on each page, recognizes Latin and Arabic text with PP-OCRv5 models on ONNX Runtime, and adds an invisible text layer so the PDF can be searched and copied. Managed pre and post processing; PDF bytes never reach native code. The models ship separately in PdfNetStack.Ocr.Models. MIT licensed. By Jamal Abdelkhalek, JADEV.",
